                                  value = "The corpus retains the withdrawn cross-context interpretation as well as the inquiry that followed it. The predecessor imported physics into a different problem. Its withdrawal limits what readers should take from it; the successor begins again from the specific mismatch."
                                }),
                              list("LiteralValue", {
                                  value = "An immaculate story could smooth away that interruption. Keeping it visible makes another reading possible: the work did not become trustworthy by never losing contact. Here, a correction changed its direction. That is a particular retained event, not a guarantee about every later claim."
